webp/80px-Piercing_Strike_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Piercing Strike\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Piercing_Strike_Icon.webp/40px-Piercing_Strike_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c4/Piercing_Strike_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Piercing_Strike\" title=\"Piercing Strike\">Piercing Strike</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Stab an enemy and possibly inflict <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gaping_Wounds_(Condition)\" title=\"Gaping Wounds (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ab/Open_Wound_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Open_Wound_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ab/Open_Wound_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Open_Wound_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ab/Open_Wound_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Open_Wound_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gaping Wounds\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ab/Open_Wound_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Open_Wound_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ab/Open_Wound_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gaping_Wounds_(Condition)\" title=\"Gaping Wounds (Condition)\">Gaping Wounds</a>. (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Short rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">Short rest</a>.)</dd>\n</dl></div>  \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This dagger is identical to the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ritual_Dagger_of_Shar\" title=\"Ritual Dagger of Shar\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/61/Dagger_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Dagger_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/61/Dagger_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Dagger_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/61/Dagger_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Dagger_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/61/Dagger_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Dagger_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/61/Dagger_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link f